  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <div rend="parallel">
            <lg xml:id="TK1092">
<l>kaṇkaḷavu koḷḷuñ ciṟunōkkaṅ kāmattiṟ</l>
<l>cempāka maṉṟu peritu</l>            
            </lg>
            <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The Furtive lightning glance that is turned on the lover the moment 
  that his eyes are turned aside, is not merely the half of love; it is more than a moiety. </l>
            </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Parimēlaḻakar</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-Pari1">
          (i - ḷ). ituvum atu.
          </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... 
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-Pari2">
          kaṇ kaḷavukoḷḷum ciṟunōkkam - ivaḷ kaṇkaḷ yāṉ kāṇāmal eṉmēl 
          nōkkukiṉṟa arukiyanōkkam; kāmattil cempākam aṉṟu peritu - meyyuṟupuṇarcciyiṉ otta pātiyaḷavu aṉṟu. ataṉiṉum mikum eṉṟavāṟu.</p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          [The interrogative base form?] His feet.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-Pari3">
          tāṉ nōkkiyavaḻi nāṇiyiṟaiñciyum nōkkāvaḻi uṟṟu nōkkiyum varutalāl 'kaḷavukoḷḷum' eṉṟum, aktu uḷatāṅkālam 
          ciṟitākaliṉ 'ciṟunōkkam' eṉṟum, aktu uḷappāṭuḷvaḻi nikaḻvatākaliṉ iṉip puṇartal orutalai eṉpāṉ 'cempākamaṉṟu peritu' eṉṟum kūṟiṉāṉ.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          [The interrogative base form?] His feet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Maṇakkuṭavar</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) eṉ kaṇkaḷaic cōrvupārttuc kaḷaviṉāl nōkkukiṉṟa ciṟiyanōkkam, vēṇṭappaṭṭa poruḷiṟ pātiyēyaṉṟu; peritu eṉṟavāṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK2-M2">
          talaimakaḷ talaimakaṉ kāṇāmai nōkkutaliṉ. itu kaḷavāyiṟṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          Because it is only 
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Parippeṟumāḷ</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) eṉ kaṇkaḷaic cōrvupārttuc kaḷaviṉāl nōkkukiṉṟa ciṟiyanōkkam, vēṇṭappaṭṭa poruḷiṟ pātiyēyaṉṟu; peritu eṉṟavāṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK2-M2">
          cōrvu pārttalāvatu, talaimakaṉ taṉatu kātaliṉālē eppoḻutum nōkkuvaṉaṉṟē ; talaimakaḷukkum avvāṟu 
          nōkka vēṇṭutaliṉ avaṉ pārākkālattaik kuṟittu niṟṟal. kaḷaviṉāṉ nōkkutalāvatu. akkālattē nōkkutal. talaimakaṉ kāṇāmal nōkkutaliṉ 
          kaḷavu āyiṟṟu. koḷḷutal nōkkutaṟ poruḷmēl varutaliṉ nōkku āyiṟṟu. ciṟunōkkamāvatu pārttatum mīḷutal. neṭitu nērakkāmaiyiṉ ciṟitāyiṟṟu. vēṇtappaṭṭa porulāvatu puṇarcci. 
          cempāka maṉṟu peritu eṉpatu ataṟkup pāti icaivukku mēlē peṟṟēm eṉpatu. itu maṟaiya nōkkutal uṭampāṭu eṉṟatu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          Because it is only 
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Paritiyār</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) kaṇ kaḷavukoṇṭu kaṭaikkaṇittup pārttapārvai cemmai aḻakupeṟṟa kāmakkūṭṭattilum peritu eṉṟavāṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
      <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Kāliṅkar</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) iṅṅaṉam ivaḷatu kaṇkaḷāṉavai vēṟu pulappaṭātavāṟu tām kātal urupiṉaik kavarntu 
          koḷvatu pōlum ciṟunōkkamāṉatu kāmac cuvaiyaip pakuttuṇariṉ yāṇṭum paranta muḻu nōkkuṭaiya 
          kalaviyāṉa kāmattiṟ cevvaṉam pakutta pākaccuvaip paṅku ; eṉave, aṉṟiyum piṉṉum periteṉalām eṉṟu 
          iṅṅaṉam peṟṟāṉ pōlvatōr paṟṟukkōṭu eyticciṟitu paṭar tīrntāṉ eṉpatu poruḷ eṉṟavāṟu. 
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
